# iPad playtest loop

When the user reports Starhaven gameplay or host bugs from an iPad (especially via the Cursor iOS app), follow `AGENTS.md` and `.cursor/skills/starhaven-ipad-loop/SKILL.md`.

- **`dev` is the pixel pack** (`index.html`, `js/`, `css/`, `media/`, `vendor/`). Gameplay fixes: edit those files, commit, push `prateekranka/starhaven` **`dev`**. Cloudflare Pages deploys the static tree as-is (no `npm run build`). Tell them title screen → Dev → Reload pack.
- **`main` is the Vite greybox** (`src/`/`public/`). Production pack only when asked.
- Swift/native changes: push **`main`**, then `gh workflow run testflight.yml --ref main`. `CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN` does not upload TestFlight. Sqim still needs a Mac.
- Never invent Sqim or TestFlight URLs. Never use Flowdeck.
